
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Contact &amp; volunteer</p>
      <h1>Get in touch.</h1>
      <p>Questions, Narcan requests, volunteering, sponsorship — all of it comes here.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero__grid">
        <div>
          <h2>Send us a message</h2>
          <p>We are a volunteer organization, so give us a couple of days to reply.</p>

          <!--
            FORM DELIVERY — Formsubmit.co
            Free, no server code, spam-filtered, and it keeps this a fully static site.

            [CLIENT ACTION] Replace YOUR-EMAIL@EXAMPLE.COM in the action URL below with the
            Foundation's real inbox, then submit the form once yourself. Formsubmit sends a
            one-time confirmation link to that address; the form does not deliver until it is
            clicked. After confirming, swap the address for the hashed endpoint Formsubmit
            gives you so the address is not exposed in the page source.
          -->
          <form class="form" id="contact-form"
                action="https://formsubmit.co/YOUR-EMAIL@EXAMPLE.COM"
                method="POST">

            <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New message from fcdcfoundation.org">
            <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table">
            <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="true">
            <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://www.fcdcfoundation.org/contact.html?sent=1">
            <!-- Formsubmit's own honeypot -->
            <input type="text" name="_honey" class="hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">

            <div class="field">
              <label for="name">Your name <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
              <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required autocomplete="name">
              <p class="field__error" role="alert"></p>
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="email">Your email <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" inputmode="email">
              <p class="field__help">So we can reply. We do not add anyone to a mailing list.</p>
              <p class="field__error" role="alert"></p>
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="phone">Phone <span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-text-muted)">(optional)</span></label>
              <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel">
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="subject">What is this about?</label>
              <select id="subject" name="subject">
                <option value="general">General question</option>
                <option value="narcan">Narcan training or a free kit</option>
                <option value="volunteer">Volunteering</option>
                <option value="sponsor">Business sponsorship</option>
                <option value="ride">Ride for Recovery</option>
                <option value="donation">A donation or tax receipt</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div class="field">
              <label for="message">Your message <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" required></textarea>
              <p class="field__error" role="alert"></p>
            </div>

            <button class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" type="submit">Send message</button>
            <p class="form__status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          </form>

          <div class="callout callout--gold mt-6">
            <p class="mb-0">
              <strong>This form is not for emergencies</strong>, and it is not a confidential
              clinical channel. If you or someone else needs help right now, call
              <a href="tel:988">988</a> or <a href="tel:911">911</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Foundation details</h3>
            <ul class="detail-list">
              <li>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0116 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
                <span>
                  <span class="detail-list__label">Mailing address</span>
                  The Flagler County Drug Court Foundation<br>
                  55 Black Alder Dr<br>
                  Palm Coast, FL 32137
                </span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 01-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 01-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 012.1 4.2 2 2 0 014.1 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.7c.1 1 .3 1.9.6 2.8a2 2 0 01-.4 2.1L8.1 9.9a16 16 0 006 6l1.3-1.2a2 2 0 012.1-.5c.9.3 1.8.5 2.8.6a2 2 0 011.7 2z"/></svg>
                <span>
                  <span class="detail-list__label">Phone</span>
                  <strong>[CLIENT TO SUPPLY]</strong>
                </span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m2 7 10 6 10-6"/></svg>
                <span>
                  <span class="detail-list__label">Email</span>
                  <strong>[CLIENT TO CONFIRM]</strong>
                </span>
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 21h18M5 21V7l7-4 7 4v14M9 21v-5h6v5"/></svg>
                <span>
                  <span class="detail-list__label">Organization</span>
                  501(c)(3) nonprofit<br>
                  EIN 27-1349987<br>
                  Established 2009
                </span>
              </li>
            </ul>

            <div class="placeholder">
              <p class="mb-0"><strong>[CLIENT TO SUPPLY]</strong> Public phone number, the
              inbox you want messages delivered to, and your Facebook page URL. Facebook is
              where most of your traffic comes from, so we want that link in the footer.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card mt-5">
            <h3>Volunteer with us</h3>
            <p>
              Our team is entirely local volunteers. We need help staffing events, handing out
              Narcan, and running the annual Ride for Recovery — and we need people willing to
              speak plainly about recovery in their own circles.
            </p>
            <p class="mb-0">
              Use the form and choose <em>Volunteering</em>, and tell us what you are good at.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="narrow text-center" style="margin-inline:auto">
        <h2>Or just support the work.</h2>
        <p>Giving takes a minute and funds a ride, a test, or a kit this month.</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="justify-content:center">
          <a class="btn btn--donate btn--lg" href="ways-to-give.html" data-donate>Donate</a>
          <a class="btn btn--outline" href="ways-to-give.html#monthly">Give monthly</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
